<para>
  <classname>BasicDirect</classname> is a <link
  linkend="Section-Concepts-Mesh-Solvers-Matrix">matrix equation
  solver</link> used in <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-BasicSolverMode"/>.  It uses the
  <xref linkend="RegisteredClass-SimplicialLDLT"/> method for
  symmetric matrices and the <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-SparseQR"/> method for asymmetric matrices.
</para>


